This integration is a new implementation in Python. Its behaviour (the Glue
API calls, the mapping from lock events to lock state and the polling rules)
follows two Homebridge plugins, both licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

  - GlueHome/homebridge-plugin, by GlueHome
  - MatsCedergren/homebridge-glue-lock-v2, by Mats Cedergren

